From: wangjianxin <wangjianxin@canaan-creative.com>
Date: Sat, 9 May 2026 10:26:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add k230 board support for K230 CANMV boards

- Add k230_canmv_01studio board definition with LED and KEY pins
- Add k230_canmv_lckfb board definition with LED pin
- Add k230 microcontroller pin definitions (IO0-IO63)
- Import k230 board and microcontroller modules

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
